==Strategy==
One of the hardest stages in the subchapter, the rematch against Naala could prove to be a nightmare for most.

This stage brings back Naala with a stronger Aku support this time around, meaning a unit like [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone]] works incredibly well here. If one has [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]], he may be of help to subdue the Aku Gories, but won't provide further help against the shielded Ackeys and surge immune Naala and Wild Doges.

It's recommended that you stall in the beginning until the Kang Roo shows up, who you can then kill for a boost of cash that will likely be your only major source throughout the entire fight. Dispose of the Ackey as soon as you possibly can with the help of [[Shield Piercing|shield piercers]] such as [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]]. Additionally, if Ackey is behind Naala, Barrel Cat's LD can help to pierce its shield. Once you're done with that, chip Naala down as much as possible before the second one shows up. Once the second one dies, Naala won't be much of a threat and the stage is effectively won. Keep in mind that despite Naala having the Relic trait, [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi]] is not a good choice here as she will be juggled by Naala's multi-hit and will not likely get more than one hit in.

